OL,3,CManchester City agree to sell Rodri to
OL,4,CBarcelona for #65.4m
OL,6,FManchester City have reportedly agreed
OL,7,Fto sell Rodri to Barcelona in a deal
OL,8,Fworth #65.4 million.
OL,10,FThe 30-year-old, who lifted the World
OL,11,FCup with Spain in the summer, had
OL,12,Fentered the final year of his contract
OL,13,Fat the Etihad Stadium and was the
OL,14,Fsubject of interest from both
OL,15,FBarcelona and their Spanish rivals
OL,16,FReal Madrid.
OL,18,FBarcelona had seen an opening offer of
OL,19,F#40m rejected and failed with an
OL,20,Fincreased bid before it is believed
OL,21,Freaching an agreement on 16 August.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
