OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1787217514
OL,3,CManchester City agree to sell Rodri to
OL,4,CBarcelona for #65.4m
OL,6,FSpeaking after City's 3-0 Community
OL,7,FShield loss to Arsenal, Enzo Maresca
OL,8,Fcalled Rodri a "top player" and said
OL,9,F"all the teams need Rodri", but City
OL,10,Fhave been unable to persuade him to
OL,11,Fstay and sign a new contract.
OL,13,FRodri had only returned to the club on
OL,14,F14 August, having undergone back
OL,15,Fsurgery following the World Cup, with
OL,16,FMaresca saying he had given him a "big
OL,17,Fhug" when he first met up with him.
