OL,3,CManchester City agree to sell Rodri to
OL,4,CBarcelona for #65.4m
OL,6,FRodri has spent seven seasons with
OL,7,FCity, winning the Premier League four
OL,8,Ftimes and scoring the only goal when
OL,9,Fthey beat Inter Milan in the 2023
OL,10,FChampions League final.
OL,12,FThe following year he won the Ballon
OL,13,Fd'Or but by the time he was presented
OL,14,Fwith the trophy he was sidelined with
OL,15,Fan anterior cruciate ligament which
OL,16,Fruled him out of most of the 2024-25
OL,17,Fcampaign, while hamstring and groin
OL,18,Fproblems limited him to 33 appearances
OL,19,Fin Pep Guardiola's final campaign in
OL,20,Fcharge.
