OL,3,CManchester City agree to sell Rodri to
OL,4,CBarcelona for #65.4m
OL,6,FCity have already undergone major
OL,7,Fchanges in midfield this summer,
OL,8,Fspending #116m on Elliot Anderson,
OL,9,Fwhile agreeing a deal to sell Tijjani
OL,10,FReijnders to Al Qadisah.
OL,12,FThey have been linked with Lille's
OL,13,FAyyoub Bouaddi and Chelsea's Enzo
OL,14,FFernandez.
